Note on third-party components this launcher drives: the Retoque 0.3.3
deploy engine (an OptiScaler fork) is GPL-3.0 and is NOT distributed in
this repository — the launcher drives a locally cached, hash-pinned copy
(see README). NVIDIA's DLSS 5 NR model (`nvngx_dlssnr.dll`) is NVIDIA's
software and is likewise never redistributed here; it is referenced by
hash pin only.
